## Summary

Technical Artist with 6+ years of experience building and maintaining art pipelines for game production. Strong Tool Development background across Blender, 3ds Max, and Maya, with hands-on experience automating asset conversion/validation, integrating content into custom and proprietary game engines, and mentoring junior artists. Comfortable working without off-the-shelf DCC-to-engine plugins, building tools from scratch.


</section>
<section>

## Skills

**DCC Tools & Scripting:** Python, MaxScript (pymxs), Blender (bpy), PySide2, 3ds Max, Maya

**Pipeline & Engine Integration:** Custom/proprietary engine asset integration, batch conversion & validation, import/export tooling, plugins

**Art Production:** Modeling, texturing, UVs, rigging, animation, shaders (HLSL, URP, GLSL)

**Web/Tooling Support:** Three.js, WebGL, GLSL, Svelte, TypeScript

**Other:** Documentation, cross-team collaboration (artists/designers/engineers), mentoring, hiring & reviews, R&D

